(
 '# Examples'
 ''
 '## Edit'
 ''
 'The `Edit` method allows you to edit a variable (vector of text vectors) in the workspace:'
 ''
 '~~~'
 'Notepad.Edit ''This is a text'' ''with two lines'''
 '~~~'
 ''
 '![](Images/Notepad/01.png)'
 ''
 '## EditFile'
 ''
 'The `EditFile` method allows you to edit a file on disk:'
 ''
 '~~~'
 'fn←FilesAndDirs.GetTempFileName'''''
 '(⊂''This is a simple string'') FilesAndDirs.NPUT fn 1'
 'Notepad.EditFile fn'
 '~~~'
 ''
 '![](Images/Notepad/02.png)'
 ''
 '## Browse'
 ''
 'The `Browse` method allows you to display a variable (vector of text vectors) in the workspace:'
 ''
 '~~~'
 '#.APLGUI.Notepad.Browse ''This is a text'' ''with two lines'''
 '~~~'
 ''
 '![](Images/Notepad/03.png)'
 ''
 '## BrowseFile'
 ''
 'The `BrowseFile` method allows you to browse a file on disk:'
 ''
 '~~~'
 'fn←FilesAndDirs.GetTempFileName'''''
 '(⊂''This is a simple string'') FilesAndDirs.NPUT fn 1'
 'Notepad.BrowseFile fn'
 '~~~'
 ''
 '![](Images/Notepad/04.png)'
)
